# Workspaces (actions/actions_workspaces.kbd)
**workspaces + spc**      -- Show Desktops (M-w)
**workspaces + toggle**   -- Desktops Toggle
**workspaces + j**        -- Next Screen (M-S-down)
**workspaces + k**        -- Prev Screen (M-S-up)
**workspaces + l**        -- Next Desktop (M-C-right)
**workspaces + h**        -- Prev Desktop (M-C-left)
**workspaces + move + j** -- Move Window To Next Screen (M-S-right)
**workspaces + move + k** -- Move Window To Prev Screen (M-S-left)
**workspaces + move + l** -- Move Window To Next Desktop (M-C-S-right)
**workspaces + move + h** -- Move Window To Prev Desktop (M-C-S-left)
